From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Haoze <haozegao0602@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 17:46:24 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 09/10] [shvla] snitch fp_ss: Iss::handle_event waits while
 exec.is_stalled() (IO_REQ_PENDING FP access, SIMULATOR_NOTES #1)

Offloaded FP loads/stores to HBM / L3 / remote TCDM return IO_REQ_PENDING; the
subsystem completed them after the fixed latency anyway (optimistic timing, stale
freg, in-flight IoReq reuse). Guard is the first statement of handle_event, before
acc_req_ready=true: re-enqueue(1) until Lsu::data_response has called stalled_dec.

Two places: nested core working tree snitch/snitch_fp_ss.cpp and a new file section
in soft_hier/gvsoc_core.patch (applies without fuzz to pristine nested core HEAD
bda268a4, cmp-identical). The author's gvsoc_snitch_fp_ss_pending.patch was not
available; reconstructed from SIMULATOR_NOTES #1.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 soft_hier/gvsoc_core.patch | 21 +++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 21 insertions(+)

diff --git a/soft_hier/gvsoc_core.patch b/soft_hier/gvsoc_core.patch
index b10d5ed..8ed25b1 100644
--- a/soft_hier/gvsoc_core.patch
+++ b/soft_hier/gvsoc_core.patch
@@ -3440,6 +3440,27 @@ index c7b46b87..d4cb9adb 100644
  
      // -----------USE MASTER AND SLAVE PORT TO HANDLE OFFLOAD REQUEST------------------
      this->event = this->top.event_new((vp::Block *)this, handle_event);
+diff --git a/models/cpu/iss/src/snitch/snitch_fp_ss.cpp b/models/cpu/iss/src/snitch/snitch_fp_ss.cpp
+index ab1fe855..86eb4ab2 100644
+--- a/models/cpu/iss/src/snitch/snitch_fp_ss.cpp
++++ b/models/cpu/iss/src/snitch/snitch_fp_ss.cpp
+@@ -246,6 +246,16 @@ void Iss::handle_event(vp::Block *__this, vp::ClockEvent *event)
+ {
+     Iss *_this = (Iss *)__this;
+ 
++    // An offloaded FP load/store to HBM, L3 or remote TCDM returns IO_REQ_PENDING: the LSU stalls
++    // this subsystem (exec.insn_stall) until Lsu::data_response. Do not complete the instruction
++    // (and do not report the subsystem ready) before that response has arrived; retry next cycle.
++    // (SIMULATOR_NOTES #1, gvsoc_snitch_fp_ss_pending.patch)
++    if (_this->exec.is_stalled())
++    {
++        _this->event->enqueue(1);
++        return;
++    }
++
+     _this->acc_req_ready = true;
+     
+     iss_reg_t pc = _this->acc_req.pc;
 diff --git a/models/cpu/iss/src/spatz.cpp b/models/cpu/iss/src/spatz.cpp
 index e4cb6c51..4db4b1a3 100644
 --- a/models/cpu/iss/src/spatz.cpp
